# Current and future project participants from Germany, Austria and Italy visit Bukoba
## Sports equipment
We had spare luggage allowance and it was suggested that the schools often lack sports equipment.
The "Eine Welt Gruppe" at the Franz MArkt Gymnasium where Fr. Nikolaus had presented in April, decided to organise a collection amognst the students, ball, sports shoes, T-shirts and other sport equipment were collected.
## Who went
